tom of the request.\n\nKey design notes:\n- She has pink drill twintails with large white ribbons\n- Her eyes are purple\n- When her mouth is open, you can see a single fang\n\nShe is an idol with a prankster personality! Since she loves to run around and disappear, she's often compared to a ninja!\n\nThere are various costumes in the reference material. I'd be happy for you to choose one that you like! She usually wears kimono-style idol costumes. Since you appealed, I'll leave it to you.\n\nThank you for your consideration! Sorry if anything sounds strange in the machine translation.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/u/1/folders/1Jj_gVfYjNFrguhoslkzE_Mm5oFCB8xAD", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@miimi_1012/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 735359, "client_id": 3182585, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/66f780b8/uploads/origins/0301af79-90c9-493c-b1eb-2227d1d9e41f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a7d8d14e33a1a26eeb7547a3f40972fe", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/66f780b8/uploads/origins/0301af79-90c9-493c-b1eb-2227d1d9e41f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a7d8d14e33a1a26eeb7547a3f40972fe, https://si.imgix.net/66f780b8/uploads/origins/0301af79-90c9-493c-b1eb-2227d1d9e41f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fa82291a9dfbd6d09adb0cfe8a50f7ac 2x, https://si.imgix.net/66f780b8/uploads/origins/0301af79-90c9-493c-b1eb-2227d1d9e41f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5ad66fc70dcba99a5639d1c8c603f99a 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/66f780b8/uploads/origins/0301af79-90c9-493c-b1eb-2227d1d9e41f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&